From 03871262b24477f88f8753500b86ce90e475bb15 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jeremy Gollehon <jeremy@thegollys.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Jan 2026 15:09:32 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1080/5749] feat(concurrency): prevent background task races
 and leaks
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Ensure queue waiters settle once, centralize completion with status guards, and release slots before async work so shutdown and cancellations don’t leak concurrency. Internal hardening only.
---
